      "content": "Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\boxed{}.\n\nHow many cups of clay does each student need for one dish? Jada makes three times as many clay dishes as Rory. Rory makes 22 more clay dishes than Kora. Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay.",
