    {
      "content": "Each clay dish requires 2 cups of clay, so each student needs:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ cups for one dish}}\n\\]\n\nWith the updated information: Kora makes 20 dishes, Rory makes 40, and Jada makes 80.",
      "role": "assistant"
